# new-character: from the title menu, "Start a new party", then the first character box from the
# keyboard: race (Human Male), class (Fighter), alignment (Lawful Good), to the portraits and the
# rolled abilities. The class menu's loop tests the mouse (IsMouseInRect) on every turn.
option insns 120000000
wait 600
key DOWN
wait 10
key ENTER
wait 300
key ENTER
wait 60
shot race
key ENTER
wait 60
shot class
key ENTER
wait 60
shot alignment
key ENTER
wait 100
shot abilities
quit
